<title>FINLAND: TABLE - TT TIETO H1 PROFIT RISES 44 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>TABLE - TT TIETO H1 PROFIT RISES 44 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-June, 1997,</p>
<p>					(million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before tax				122.6 vs 85.2</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   9.18 vs 5.40</p>
<p> EPS less depreciation of goodwill	  10.71 vs 6.78</p>
<p> Net sales					1,204.3 vs 976.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish data systems</p>
<p>and services group TT-Tieto's first-half profit before</p>
<p>extraordinary items and tax had been 116 million markka (range</p>
<p>109-133 mln).</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation     191.3 vs 130.2</p>
<p> Depreciation					75.0 vs 60.5</p>
<p> Operating profit				 116.3 vs 69.7</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items	  122.6 vs 85.2</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				nil vs nil</p>
<p> Taxes						 41.9 vs 37.4</p>
<p> Minorities				    gain 0.1 vs 0.5 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					  80.8 vs 47.3</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    60.6 vs 56.8</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE)(percent)	     10.2 vs 7.0</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI)(percent)	 15.0 vs 11.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Company's full name is TT Tieto Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
